            {
              "role": "bl",
              "expanderId": "io-expander-xl9555",
              "expanderPin": 8
            },
            {
              "role": "rst",
              "expanderId": "io-expander-xl9555",
              "expanderPin": 10
            }
          ]
        },
        "kconfig": null,
        "note": {
          "en": "16-bit RGB565 connector (J1) — no panel fitted; attach any compatible RGB panel. Data/DE/PCLK are on fixed MCU GPIOs; backlight and reset are driven via the XL9555 expander (bl=#8, rst=SLCD_RST #10). RGB data pins are shared with the DVP camera header and the on-board I2S audio — only one function can use them at a time.",
          "zh-CN": "16 位 RGB565 接插件 (J1) —— 未接屏，可接任意兼容 RGB 屏。数据/DE/PCLK 走固定 MCU GPIO；背光和复位经 XL9555 扩展器驱动（bl=#8，rst=SLCD_RST #10）。RGB 数据脚与 DVP 摄像头排针、板载 I2S 音频共用，同一时刻只能用其一。"
        },
        "group": "rgb-lcd-panel"
      }
    ],
    "audio": [
      {
        "id": "audio-es8388",
        "name": {
          "en": "ES8388 Audio Codec",
          "zh-CN": "ES8388 音频编解码器"
        },
