          "en": "16-bit I2C IO expander at address 0x20; drives LCD backlight, speaker enable, touch/camera reset and on-board keys.",
          "zh-CN": "16 位 I2C IO 扩展芯片，地址 0x20；用于驱动 LCD 背光、喇叭使能、触摸/摄像头复位及板载按键。"
        },
